; ============================================================
; level.inc  -  PERSON 2  (Module 3)
; The level: 60 columns x 12 rows, one byte per tile, row after row.
; Tile codes come from constants.inc (T_SKY, T_GROUND, ...).
; Index of tile (col,row) = row*MAP_W + col.   Row 0 = HUD strip.
; Legend: 0 sky, 1 ground, 2 brick, 3 ?-coin, 4 ?-mushroom, 5 empty,
;         6-9 pipe TL/TR/BL/BR, 10 stair, 11 coin, 12 flag pole.
;
; Level contents (Section 5.15 minimums):
;   pits      : cols 20-22 (3 wide) and cols 38-39 (2 wide)
;   pipes     : cols 29-30 (2 high) and cols 33-34 (3 high)
;   ?-coin    : (13,6) (15,6) (26,6)        ?-mushroom: (8,6) (43,6)
;   bricks    : group 1 = (12,6) (14,6) (16,6)
;               group 2 = (42,6) (44,6) (45,6)
;   free coins: (20-22,6) over pit 1, (37-40,6) over pit 2, (46-48,6)
;   end       : 4 stair steps at cols 49-52, flag pole col 56 rows 2-8,
;               base block at (56,9)
; Reachability: blocks and coins are on row 6, so a standing hop
; reaches them (jump is about 3.8 tiles = 60 px).
; ============================================================
